  "Number": 4,
  "Question": "If \\(a=1,\\) \\(b=10,\\) \\(c=100\\) and \\(d=1000,\\) then \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(a+b+c-d)+(a+b-c+d)\\\\ &\\quad+(a-b+c+d)\\\\ &\\quad+(-a+b+c+d) \\end{aligned} \\] is equal to",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(1111\\)",
    "B": "\\(2222\\)",
    "C": "\\(3333\\)",
    "D": "\\(1212\\)",
    "E": "\\(4242\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "Each of \\(a,b,c,d\\) appears positively in three parentheses and negatively in one. Thus each has total coefficient \\(3-1=2\\). The expression simplifies to\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n2(a+b+c+d)\n&=2(1+10+100+1000)\\\\\n&=2(1111)=2222.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(2222\\), choice B.",
